{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/extras/a6e8485b962a8ef39cc7bdc4a563eeaf.avif?t=1762485754\" width=660 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the \u201cPaw-City\u201d where a variety of animals live together!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an employee of the \u201cRailroad Corp.\u201d, you are in charge of \u2028designing railroads and connecting animal towns. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect the Paw-City with your creative strategies and designs!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/extras/542b547d2e905e4dd9c441f7c6f6bf57.avif?t=1762485754\" width=660 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Design a railroad to connect animal towns!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The train starts running along the railroad you designed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have a new animal town, don't panic, just delete the railroad and redesign it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make animal residents comfortable on the train!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/extras/44b7433d54f21f703a78a901272ffd32.poster.avif?t=1762485754\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/extras/44b7433d54f21f703a78a901272ffd32.webm?t=1762485754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/extras/44b7433d54f21f703a78a901272ffd32.mp4?t=1762485754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/extras/f0f4b1cdb41cf53c447b52b4dcbdba70.avif?t=1762485754\" width=660 height=102 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Items are a great help in railroad design!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At set times, we'll give you items to help you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use them to strategize your railroad!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/extras/8eac97491fce53efce7b4c702e0c2757.poster.avif?t=1762485754\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/extras/8eac97491fce53efce7b4c702e0c2757.webm?t=1762485754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/extras/8eac97491fce53efce7b4c702e0c2757.mp4?t=1762485754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/extras/04951283e44649f5e0b314237d94b3bf.avif?t=1762485754\" width=660 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don't panic if your railroad suddenly breaks!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your Paw-City grows, disasters can suddenly strike and ruin your routes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of items and your brilliant strategy to respond efficiently!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep designing efficient railroads for them \u2028and grow your Paw City!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/extras/9bae210044d33a12d533cb0bc4c67750.poster.avif?t=1762485754\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/extras/9bae210044d33a12d533cb0bc4c67750.webm?t=1762485754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/extras/9bae210044d33a12d533cb0bc4c67750.mp4?t=1762485754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3422460?t=1762485754","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3422460?t=1762485754","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/4c6a0bd516da66a84406cbb50318e94765b5918b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762485754","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/4c6a0bd516da66a84406cbb50318e94765b5918b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762485754","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3427290,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/extras/e993ffa5f9a93129437ca185ecc1c219.avif?t=1762485754\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/extras_big/e993ffa5f9a93129437ca185ecc1c